endstreamendobj1705 0 obj<</A 1706 0 R/Alt(A cartoonish illustration shows three pictures from left to right. Left: A man walks with a dog. He holds a walking cane with a key in one hand, and a dog's leash in the other. Center: A woman stands beside a baby stroller with a key in her hand. Right: A\ young couple walks holding hands, and the young woman has a key in her hand.\r\n␀)/K 63/P 1658 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj1709 0 obj<</A 1710 0 R/Alt(A cartoonish illustration shows three pictures from left to right. Left: A male doctor in professional attire holds a writing pad with paper in one hand and a key in the other. Center: A woman in a wheelchair holds a key. Right: A young woman wears a back\pack and holds some books and a key.\r\n␀)/K 64/P 1658 0 R/Pg 9 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj1714 0 obj<</A 1715 0 R/Alt(An illustration shows an elderly man standing in front of a house with a key in his hand and saying, "No." Many people of different age groups stand in front of the man with boards and protest. A long speech bubble featuring many exclamatory marks is pres\ent above the people. The people include married couples, pregnant woman, a child, people with disabilities, and young and elderly people.\r\n␀)/K 36/P 1658 0 R/Pg 65 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj1774 0 obj<</A 1775 0 R/Alt(An illustration shows a Christmas reef decoration equals a candle stand with nine lighted candles. Below the illustration is the owner of a house questioning about geographic locations and nationalities, and this is marked as wrong.\r\n␀)/K 27/P 1658 0 R/Pg 386 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj1821 0 obj<</A 1822 0 R/Alt(An illustration at the top shows that income equals Veteran benefits equals dollars equals CalWorks equals SSI equals Bank statement. At the bottom, an illustration shows a male worker holding a hammer and a currency, which equals a woman holding a file a\nd a check, which equals an elderly man holding a check, which equals a male doctor holding a writing pad with paper and a check, which equals a young woman wearing a backpack and holding some books and a currency, and this equals a man holding a check.\r\\n␀)/K 12/P 1658 0 R/Pg 680 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj1842 0 obj<</A 1843 0 R/Alt(An illustration from left to right shows the following. 1. A door on a notice reads, Adults-only in laundry room. This is marked by an X mark in red. A boy goes into the room. This is marked by a tick symbol. 2. A sign board on the wall shows "No Skating.\" This is marked wrong. A girl skates outdoors, and this is marked by a tick symbol. 3. Children play with a ball in a parking lot. This is marked by a tick mark. A text that reads, "No playing in the parking lot" is marked wrong. 4. A signboard on the wa\ll reads, "Children in common areas must be supervised at all times." This is marked wrong. A couple of kids play outdoors, and this is marked by a tick symbol.\r\n␀)/K 25/P 1658 0 R/Pg 738 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj1887 0 obj<</A 1888 0 R/Alt(An illustration shows two things. A woman holds a signed rental agreement, plus a baby equals a tick mark. A woman holds a signed rental agreement, plus a baby, plus an elderly man, plus a male worker holding a hammer, plus a male doctor, plus a young wom\an wearing a backpack and holding files equals a tick mark. \r\n␀)/K 13/P 1658 0 R/Pg 750 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj1895 0 obj<</A 1896 0 R/Alt(An illustration shows the back view of a man standing in front of a couple of doors. A notice on the left door reads, APT 2 BD/2 BA. English Only. The notice on the right door is in a language other than English. Both these notices are marked by an X mark\ in red. An advertisement reads, "Key Features. Bedrooms: 2 Beds/Bathrooms: 1 Bath, Lease duration: 1 year, Pets Policy: No pets allowed, and Laundry: On-site. Description: Spectacular 2 bedroom/1 bathroom spacious unit, with lots of natural light. Very w\ell kept Apartment Complex with nearby shopping, schools, and freeways. Apartment features lots of kitchen cabinets, crown moldings throughout, dishwasher, and lots of windows. One parking space included. Laundry onsite. This is a Must See!!! English Only\! Our Application Guidelines:" In this advertisement, the statement "English Only!"  is marked with an X mark in red. \r\n␀)/K 14/P 1658 0 R/Pg 750 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj1904 0 obj<</A 1905 0 R/Alt(An illustration on the left shows a man with a physical disability holding a walking cane and a dog. An elderly man standing in front of a house says "No" to the disabled man.  A tick mark points to the dog, and an X mark to the word "No." An illustration\ on the right shows the back view of a man standing in front of a door. A notice on the door reads, 2 BD/2 BA. No Pets. No Exceptions." An X mark in red is marked, pointing to the "No pets" sign.\r\n␀)/K 14/P 1658 0 R/Pg 812 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj1911 0 obj<</A 1912 0 R/Alt(An illustration shows a two-storied building. A woman in a wheelchair approaches the building. A parking lot for people with disabilities is provided close to the building and is indicated with a sign board. A tick mark points to the sign board. On the gr\ound floor, a female caregiver assists a man in a wheelchair. A tick mark points to the caregiver. On the first floor, an elderly man with a disability pays the owner of the house. A woman stands beside the disabled man with a document. A tick mark points\ to the woman.\r\n␀)/K 15/P 1658 0 R/Pg 812 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj1932 0 obj<</A 1933 0 R/Alt(An illustration shows a two-storied building. On the ground floor, the owner of the house reads out the housing papers to a man with visual impairment. This is marked by a tick mark. On the first floor, a man in a wheelchair uses a ramped surface covered \with a floor mat to go up. A tick mark points to the surface with the floor mat.\r\n␀)/K 12/P 1658 0 R/Pg 976 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj1953 0 obj<</A 1954 0 R/Alt(An illustration shows that a Mexico passport equals a Philippines passport, which equals a passport of the People's Republic of China, which equals a passport of the Republic of Korea, and which equals a California passport. The Individual Taxpayer Identi\fication Number \(IRS ITIN\) card and Social Security Number \(SSN\) card are marked with an X mark in red, indicating not required.\r\n␀)/K 13/P 1658 0 R/Pg 976 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj1960 0 obj<</A 1961 0 R/Alt(An illustration at the top shows five things from left to right marked with X marks in red. 1. Different religious symbols as a sign of religious discrimination. 2. A man and a woman snatching a kid, 3. A terrorist with a gun, 4. The smell of a cooked non\-vegetarian dish, and 5. Loud music from a cassette. At the bottom, an illustration shows the owner of a house in conversation with a medical professional, a young woman wearing a backpack and holding books, and a man.\r\n␀)/K 34/P 1658 0 R/Pg 1052 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj1984 0 obj<</A 1985 0 R/Alt(An illustration shows the following. A male worker holding a ladder. A male owner holding a key. A male real estate agent standing near a house sign board. A man standing at a reception counter.\r\n␀)/K 33/P 1658 0 R/Pg 1052 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj2017 0 obj<</A 2018 0 R/Alt(An illustration at the top shows five things from left to right marked with X marks in red. 1. Different religious symbols as a sign of religious discrimination. 2. A man and a woman snatching a kid, 3. A terrorist with a gun, 4. The smell of a cooked non\-vegetarian dish, and 5. Loud music from a cassette. At the bottom, an illustration shows a man and a woman having a fierce conversation with a doctor and a young woman wearing a backpack and holding books.\r\n␀)/K 12/P 1658 0 R/Pg 1321 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj2023 0 obj<</A[2024 0 R]/Alt(An illustration shows a door labeled, C R D, a smartphone displaying a number that reads, "800 hyphen 884 hyphen 1684," and a Complaint email addressed to contact dot center at the rate c a l civil rights dot c a dot g o v, with a send button at the botto\m left.\r\n␀)/K 13/P 1658 0 R/Pg 1321 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj2250 0 obj<</Author(Civil Rights Department State of California)/ClassificationId(125287)/ClassificationText(Codemantra_Accessibility_APDF : OAT - Accessibility - UA : Amended SRS - Allspring \(Lux\) Worldwide Fund \(October 5 2022\)v3 : PDF Accessibility)/CreationDate(D:20221107085256-08'00')/Creator(Adobe InDesign 18.0 \(Windows\))/Keywords()/ModDate(D:20221221192704+05'30')/PDFName(- Housing Rights Booklet_English_a11y.pdf)/Producer(Adobe PDF Library 17.0)/Title(Know Your Top Fair Housing Rights)/Trapped/Unknown>>endobj2251 0 obj<</A 2252 0 R/Alt(An illustration shows the following. A male and female married couple equals a couple of women with disabilities, which equals a couple of men with one of them having a disability. Below the illustration, the owner of the house questioning a woman with a \baby is marked as wrong. He also questions a man standing beside a door with the symbol of Cross on it. This is also marked as wrong.\r\n␀)/K 28/P 1658 0 R/Pg 386 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobjxref
